  <item>
    <title>VarNames.jl v0.1.8</title>
    <link>https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">github-release:430729830</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:11:34 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>VarNames.jl</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Make hasvalue and getvalue work for Tuples and Refs. Improve the performance of hasvalue and getvalue by deferring to checkbounds in more cases (specifically with keyword indices). Merged pull requests: Support native indexing in value…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <content:encoded>&lt;h2&gt;VarNames v0.1.8&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/compare/v0.1.7...v0.1.8&quot;&gt;Diff since v0.1.7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make &lt;code&gt;hasvalue&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;getvalue&lt;/code&gt; work for &lt;code&gt;Tuple&lt;/code&gt;s and &lt;code&gt;Ref&lt;/code&gt;s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve the performance of &lt;code&gt;hasvalue&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;getvalue&lt;/code&gt; by deferring to &lt;code&gt;checkbounds&lt;/code&gt; in more cases (specifically with keyword indices).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merged pull requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support native indexing in value lookups (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6145996403&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/29&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/29/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/29&quot;&gt;#29&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/BJMCox/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BJMCox&quot;&gt;@BJMCox&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use bounds checks for keyword indices (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6146892741&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/32&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/32/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/32&quot;&gt;#32&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/BJMCox/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BJMCox&quot;&gt;@BJMCox&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closed issues:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support tuple indexing in canview and getvalue (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6145219400&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/27&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/27/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/27&quot;&gt;#27&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update getvalue/hasvalue for kwarg indices (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6146630286&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/31&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/31/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/31&quot;&gt;#31&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded>
  </item>
