    <guid isPermaLink="false">github-release:415787908</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:21:15 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>VarNames.jl</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Add Base.view(::VarNamedTuple, vn::VarName), which attempts to return a view of the corresponding value. This usually only makes a difference if vn is a slice of an array, e.g. @vn(x[1:100]). Merged pull requests: Add a test for merge…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
