&lt;p&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;Base.view(::VarNamedTuple, vn::VarName)&lt;/code&gt;, which attempts to return a view of the corresponding value.&lt;br&gt;
This usually only makes a difference if &lt;code&gt;vn&lt;/code&gt; is a slice of an array, e.g. &lt;code&gt;@vn(x[1:100])&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
