    <content:encoded>&lt;h2&gt;VarNames v0.1.0&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initial release.&lt;br&gt;
This is a direct port of code from AbstractPPL and DynamicPPL, with one major change: &lt;code&gt;@vn&lt;/code&gt; is now an alias for &lt;code&gt;@varname&lt;/code&gt;, which is hopefully helpful since it gets used quite a lot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merged pull requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump the all-julia-packages group across 2 directories with 9 updates (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5065346484&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/1&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/1/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/1&quot;&gt;#1&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;organization&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/orgs/dependabot/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/dependabot&quot;&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot])&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;@vn&lt;/code&gt; as a synonym for &lt;code&gt;@varname&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5088215780&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/issues/4&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/4/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/VarNames.jl/pull/4&quot;&gt;#4&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/penelopeysm/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/penelopeysm&quot;&gt;@penelopeysm&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
